      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im feeling really weird. my chest feels all heavy and tight like someone is sitting on it, and my left arm feels kinda tingly and numb too. i've been super stressed with work lately so maybe its just anxiety? i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, its so expensive and a waste of time if its nothing",
