      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Do not take those medications, as leftover prescriptions can be dangerous, and self-medicating with sedatives or supplements while experiencing these specific symptoms is extremely risky. Even though your past experience might seem reassuring, you cannot reliably determine if these new symptoms are actually anxiety or a life-threatening event based on hindsight, and attempting to treat potential cardiac issues at home is never safe. Your health is much more valuable than the cost of a hospital visit, so please make the call to get serious medical attention right now.",
