    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look, i hear you, but i'm just so tired of being told every little thing is an emergency. nothing is actually happening, it's just that heavy feeling again. i really don't want to deal with the sirens and the waiting room. can you just help me figure out if i can just take an aspirin or something and wait until morning? if i stay calm and take something for the nerves, shouldn't that be enough to prove it's just stress?",
